{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f3299a0-6c3e-88a4-86ec-87392e8f8a0f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T15:21:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:17:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:17:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Pardon me, is this the office for property taxes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is. I can help you with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. My name is Sofia Resendes. I paid my first installment a little while back and I would like to confirm that it posted to my account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly, Ms. Resendes. Could you spell your last name for me, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And do you have the bill or the account number in front of you? I will need one of those, or the property location, to pull up the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, I have the bill here. Let me find the number. [pause] It is on the top right, I believe. Is that the one that begins with the letters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The account number is usually labeled as such near the top. Read me what you see beside that label."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes, I see it now. It says account, and then the number is four, four, one, eight, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four one eight seven. One moment while I look that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for waiting. I have the account here. Ms. Resendes, the first installment payment is showing as received and posted. It was applied about two weeks ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Pardon me, did you say it posted? Fully?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the first installment is posted in full. The account shows the first payment satisfied, and the second installment remains due on its regular date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That is what I wanted to know. Could I ask you to send me a confirmation by email? I would like to have something in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. What email address would you like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, I need to be careful with this one. It is sofia dot resendes, one word after the dot, at a mail service. May I spell it slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. Go ahead whenever you are ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "S-O-F-I-A, period, R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S, and then the at sign and the mail company. It is the same as the one on file, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do see an email address on file for the account. I will send the confirmation there. Let me read back the first part to be sure it matches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It begins S-O-F-I-A, period, R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. It will go out this afternoon. If it does not arrive within a day, please check your spam folder, and call us back if it is not there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Pardon me, one more thing. I may not hear the computer when it chimes. I listen to old radio dramas while I do my chores, and the volume is usually up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It will be waiting in your inbox whenever you check. Is there anything else I can help you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are welcome, Ms. Resendes. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T15:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
